@startuml Messaging - Sequence Diagram

skinparam defaultFontName Times New Roman
skinparam sequenceMessageFontName Times New Roman
skinparam sequenceActorFontName Times New Roman
skinparam sequenceBoxFontName Times New Roman
skinparam sequenceParticipantFontName Times New Roman

title Sequence Diagram - Mengirim Pesan (All Users)

actor "User (Sender)" as Sender
actor "Recipient" as Recipient
participant "Livewire\nWirechat" as Wirechat
participant "Chat\nModel" as Chat
participant "Message\nModel" as Message
participant "Database" as DB
participant "Laravel Reverb\n(WebSocket)" as Reverb
participant "Notification" as Notif

== Akses Chat ==
Sender -> Wirechat: Akses menu Chat
activate Wirechat
Wirechat -> DB: Query user's chats
activate DB
DB --> Wirechat: Chat list
deactivate DB
Wirechat --> Sender: Tampilkan daftar chat
deactivate Wirechat

== Buat Chat Baru (Private) ==
Sender -> Wirechat: Klik "Buat Chat" → Private
activate Wirechat

note right of Wirechat
    Check permission:
    canCreateChats()
end note

Wirechat -> DB: Check existing chat\nor create new
activate DB
DB --> Wirechat: Chat instance
deactivate DB
Wirechat --> Sender: Open chat interface
deactivate Wirechat

== Buat Group Chat ==
Sender -> Wirechat: Klik "Buat Chat" → Group
activate Wirechat

note right of Wirechat
    Check permission:
    canCreateGroups
end note

Wirechat -> Chat: Create group chat\nwith participants
activate Chat
Chat -> DB: Save group & members
activate DB
DB --> Chat: Success
deactivate DB
Chat --> Wirechat: Group created
deactivate Chat

Wirechat -> Notif: Notify all members
activate Notif
Notif --> Wirechat: Sent
deactivate Notif

Wirechat --> Sender: Open group chat
deactivate Wirechat

== Buka Chat Existing ==
Sender -> Wirechat: Pilih chat dari list
activate Wirechat
Wirechat -> Message: Get chat messages
activate Message
Message -> DB: Query messages
activate DB
DB --> Message: Message history
deactivate DB
Message --> Wirechat: Messages
deactivate Message

Wirechat -> Message: Mark as read
activate Message
Message -> DB: Update read_at
activate DB
DB --> Message: Success
deactivate DB
Message --> Wirechat: Updated
deactivate Message

Wirechat --> Sender: Tampilkan riwayat pesan
deactivate Wirechat

== Kirim Pesan ==
Sender -> Wirechat: Tulis & kirim pesan
activate Wirechat
Wirechat -> Message: Create message
activate Message
Message -> DB: Save message
activate DB
DB --> Message: Success
deactivate DB
Message --> Wirechat: Message instance
deactivate Message

Wirechat -> Reverb: Broadcast message\nvia WebSocket
activate Reverb
Reverb -> Recipient: Push real-time message
Reverb --> Wirechat: Broadcasted
deactivate Reverb

Wirechat -> Notif: Send push notification\nto offline recipients
activate Notif
Notif --> Wirechat: Sent
deactivate Notif

Wirechat --> Sender: Message sent
deactivate Wirechat

== Terima Pesan (Real-time) ==
Reverb -> Recipient: Real-time message delivery
activate Recipient

alt Chat is Open
    Recipient -> Wirechat: Display new message
    activate Wirechat
    Wirechat -> Message: Mark as read
    activate Message
    Message -> DB: Update read_at
    activate DB
    DB --> Message: Success
    deactivate DB
    Message --> Wirechat: Updated
    deactivate Message

    Wirechat -> Reverb: Send read receipt
    activate Reverb
    Reverb -> Sender: Notify message read
    deactivate Reverb

    Wirechat --> Recipient: Show message
    deactivate Wirechat
else Chat Not Open
    Recipient -> Wirechat: Increment unread counter
    activate Wirechat
    Wirechat --> Recipient: Show notification\n& unread badge
    deactivate Wirechat
end

deactivate Recipient

@enduml
